things for your students, who

1407
01:11:51,580 --> 01:11:54,400
are by default not experts.

1408
01:11:54,400 --> 01:11:57,430
So perhaps to an
expert, it totally

1409
01:11:57,430 --> 01:11:59,650
makes sense, of course, code.

