1412
01:12:06,010 --> 01:12:08,290
To an expert, it's
totally readable.

1413
01:12:08,290 --> 01:12:09,542
It's totally understandable.

1414
01:12:09,542 --> 01:12:10,750
Perhaps to a novice it isn't.

1415
01:12:10,750 --> 01:12:11,416
You're laughing.

1416
01:12:11,416 --> 01:12:14,140
AUDIENCE: It's funny, because
