accessible to your students.

1422
01:12:28,390 --> 01:12:29,327
OK.

1423
01:12:29,327 --> 01:12:29,910
This is great.

1424
01:12:29,910 --> 01:12:30,890
Oh, Hina.

1425
01:12:30,890 --> 01:12:34,260
AUDIENCE: I had, it's
on a different topic.

