put them up on the wiki

1459
01:14:00,570 --> 01:14:03,810
so you'll have a record of them.

1460
01:14:03,810 --> 01:14:08,230
I wanted to just
as we go out here,

1461
01:14:08,230 --> 01:14:14,050
my point is really
that the hard part

1462
01:14:14,050 --> 01:14:15,910
is these learning outcomes.

1463
01:14:15,910 --> 01:14:17,830
And that once you write
the learning outcomes,

1464
01:14:17,830 --> 01:14:20,110
as we said before,
you kind of know

1465
01:14:20,110 --> 01:14:23,920
